<title>POLAND: BOS in PLN 80 million loan consortium.</title>
<headline>BOS in PLN 80 million loan consortium.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Bank Ochrony Srodowiska SA (BOS) is taking part in a consortium to provide power plant Elektrownia Polaniec SA an eight-year loan of 80 million zlotys ($25.9 million), BOS said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>BOS said it would provide 20 percent of the loan.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700 ($ = 3.087 Polish Zloty)</p>
